/T (The Business School is further strengthened through its international connections, with an MBA study tour to Germany taking place in October, with this tour incorporating visits to industry and universities. Students also benefited from visits by international academics, contributing to building their global knowledge and competence. For the year, academic staff members have visited Norway, Poland and Singapore, presenting key note addresses as well as guest lectures focused on the marine environment. These academics made good contacts with experts in marine management across the world with a view of future visits to Business School. )
/E (The Business School is further strengthened through its international connections, with an MBA study tour to Germany taking place in October, with this tour incorporating visits to industry and universities. Students also benefited from visits by international academics, contributing to building their global knowledge and competence. For the year, academic staff members have visited Norway, Poland and Singapore, presenting key note addresses as well as guest lectures focused on the marine environment. These academics made good contacts with experts in marine management across the world with a view of future visits to Business School. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
