/T (To our students, we encourage you to continue absorbing yourself in the learning experiences offered through the Business School. May you take full advantage of the resources, networks and events available to you, to position yourself as a leader of change and a facilitator of excellence, ethics and justice. I wish each one of you the success your desired, with success being defined very broadly. )
