/T (Reflecting on his MBA journey at NMU, Dr Gumbo highlights the value of syndicate group partnerships, collaborations that not only enriched classroom learning but extended beyond graduation. His syndicate group went on to establish an investment entity and the members remain in contact to this day. The modules that left a lasting impact on him included Entrepreneurship, Integrated African Leadership, Quantitative Statistics for Management - which sharpened his data informed decision-making as well as Strategic Management, Leadership and Organisational Behaviour.)
/E (Reflecting on his MBA journey at NMU, Dr Gumbo highlights the value of syndicate group partnerships, collaborations that not only enriched classroom learning but extended beyond graduation. His syndicate group went on to establish an investment entity and the members remain in contact to this day. The modules that left a lasting impact on him included Entrepreneurship, Integrated African Leadership, Quantitative Statistics for Management - which sharpened his data informed decision-making as well as Strategic Management, Leadership and Organisational Behaviour.)
