/T (After leaving public service, Dr Gumbo joined an EdTech startup backed by PSG, where he served as Divisional Managing Director. The company operated a digital platform that aggregated learning materials and resources into a single, user-friendly interface for schools and higher education institutions. Under his leadership, the division which had inherited a loss making business through a merger, was transformed into a profitable unit within 12 months. )
/E (After leaving public service, Dr Gumbo joined an EdTech startup backed by PSG, where he served as Divisional Managing Director. The company operated a digital platform that aggregated learning materials and resources into a single, user-friendly interface for schools and higher education institutions. Under his leadership, the division which had inherited a loss making business through a merger, was transformed into a profitable unit within 12 months. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
