/P 129 0 R
/T (This turnaround was driven by the practical application of strategies acquired during his MBA at Nelson Mandela University: from strategic models and marketing approaches for new market segments, to HR practices that enabled high team performance and sound financial management for sustainable growth. By the end of his tenure, the platform was being used by over 1000 schools and 5 higher education institutions across the country.)
/E (This turnaround was driven by the practical application of strategies acquired during his MBA at Nelson Mandela University: from strategic models and marketing approaches for new market segments, to HR practices that enabled high team performance and sound financial management for sustainable growth. By the end of his tenure, the platform was being used by over 1000 schools and 5 higher education institutions across the country.)
