/P 132 0 R
/T (Soon after, clients I had worked with over the years reached out, asking for help. Consulting gigs turned into something more - and Eammon Solutions CC was born. In its first year, we exceeded R1 million in revenue. I had flexibility, independence and the ability to choose who I worked with. The company ran successfully for three years and during that time, I also became a Board Member at the Nebula Group. Then in May 2021, another bold chapter began: I emigrated to the United States. With no job, no house and just two suitcases and two boxes, my wife and I landed in Austin, Texas. Within six weeks, I landed my first role - Group Logistics Manager at Ryder, overseeing operations for a major manufacturing client, Applied Materials. )
/E (Soon after, clients I had worked with over the years reached out, asking for help. Consulting gigs turned into something more - and Eammon Solutions CC was born. In its first year, we exceeded R1 million in revenue. I had flexibility, independence and the ability to choose who I worked with. The company ran successfully for three years and during that time, I also became a Board Member at the Nebula Group. Then in May 2021, another bold chapter began: I emigrated to the United States. With no job, no house and just two suitcases and two boxes, my wife and I landed in Austin, Texas. Within six weeks, I landed my first role - Group Logistics Manager at Ryder, overseeing operations for a major manufacturing client, Applied Materials. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
