/T (The Pinnacle Agri-Advisors Programme, offered by Nelson Mandela University Business School in collaboration with the Department of Agricultural Sciences, is designed for senior agricultural advisors in the Eastern Cape. The programme accommodates 50 participants from six districts in the Eastern Cape: Joe Gqabi, Amathole, Sarah Baartman, OR Tambo, Alfred Nzo and Chris Hani. Split into two cohorts, this diverse group brings together experienced agricultural advisors from across the province, creating opportunities for peer learning, knowledge sharing and collaboration on strategies that address regional agricultural challenges.)
/E (The Pinnacle Agri-Advisors Programme, offered by Nelson Mandela University Business School in collaboration with the Department of Agricultural Sciences, is designed for senior agricultural advisors in the Eastern Cape. The programme accommodates 50 participants from six districts in the Eastern Cape: Joe Gqabi, Amathole, Sarah Baartman, OR Tambo, Alfred Nzo and Chris Hani. Split into two cohorts, this diverse group brings together experienced agricultural advisors from across the province, creating opportunities for peer learning, knowledge sharing and collaboration on strategies that address regional agricultural challenges.)
