/T (The South African Chapter of the Indian Ocean Rim Association Academic Group \(SA IORAG\) hosted a national roadshow with the aim of raising awareness about IORA across Universities in South Africa.  The Eastern Cape event was held at the Nelson Mandela University Business School. The purpose of the roadshows are to connect researchers, universities and postgraduate students for networking and potential collaboration. Dr Jessica Fraser from the Business School spoke on the Master of Maritime Management programme offered at the institute.)
